a11y / units / adaptivity
-------------------------
  • SI only on the wire: TripDetail stores meters + watt-hours; conversion happens only
    in TripDetailDisplay at the render boundary via @Environment(\.tsUnits) (P1/S5).
  • Adaptive: LazyVGrid(.adaptive minimum:150) → 2-up compact iPhone, 4-up iPad/macOS;
    #if os(iOS) navigationBarTitleDisplayMode. Dark mode + Dynamic Type via P2 tokens.
  • a11y: StatCards/KVList combine; skeleton + ContentUnavailableView labelled; Retry button.
  • i18n: every visible literal resolves from Localizable.xcstrings; keys = web keys.

